# Notepad Search > Find (COMMDLG FindText, modeless): Find Next disabled while Find What is empty, "hello"
# found as "Hello", Match Case checked, found again as "hello", the dialog closed with Esc. Reference:
# arch311-ref scn/cdlg-find.scn (frame 01 is Notepad before the scenario starts; the check alone changed
# too few pixels for the recorder, so frame 06 holds it together with the second match).
# regress: sh tools/run-fixture-test.sh notepad "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: cdlg-find/02.png 01-find.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-find/03.png 02-typed.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-find/04.png 03-found.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-find/05.png 04-matchcase.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-find/06.png 05-found2.png ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: cdlg-find/07.png 06-closed.png ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 400
type Hello world, hello again.
key home
key alt+s
key f
sleep 400
shot shots/01-find.png
type hello
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/02-typed.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/03-found.png
key tab
sleep 400
shot shots/04-matchcase.png
key space
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/05-found2.png
key esc
sleep 400
shotcaret shots/06-closed.png
quit
